 "category_zh": "古镇村落",
 "category_en": "Ancient town",
 "intro_zh": "惠山古镇景区由原锡惠公园和惠山历史文化街区合并而成，从区域功能上划分为文物古迹区、锡惠名胜区、历史文化街区和山林保护区四个游览区。著名的景点有良渚锡山先民遗址、战国时春申君饮马处、南北朝时期惠山寺庙园林、唐代天下第二泉、宋代金莲桥、明代古园寄畅园、愚公谷。二泉书院和碧山吟社，还有自唐至民国的118个祠堂及园林以及二泉映月作曲者阿炳的墓园。",
 "intro_en": "Huishan Ancient Town Scenic Area was formed by the merger of the original Xihui Park and Huishan Historical and Cultural District. It is divided into four tourist areas in terms of regional functions: cultural relics area, Xihui scenic area, historical and cultural block and mountain forest protection area. Famous scenic spots include the ruins of the ancestors of Liangzhu Xishan, the place where Chun Shenjun drank his horse during the Warring States Period, the Huishan Temple Garden during the Southern and Northern Dynasties, the second spring in the world in the Tang Dynasty, the Golden Lotus Bridge in the Song Dynasty, the ancient garden of the Ming Dynasty, Jichang Garden, and the Yugong Valley. Erquan Academy and Bishan Yinshe, as well as 118 ancestral halls and gardens from the Tang Dynasty to the Republic of China, and the cemetery of A Bing, the composer of Erquan Yingyue.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
